<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (As a revert, one of the biggest challenges for me was understanding not just how to pray, but why we do certain actions in Salah. This presentation has been incredibly helpful, breaking everything down in a simple and visual way that's easy to follow. The explanations of prayer times, intention, and the step by step guide to Salah have really improved my understanding and confidence. I would highly recommend it to reverts, beginners, or anyone looking to refresh their knowledge. JazakAllahu Khayran to everyone involved.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
